@startuml
title 分析状态机图（一）— 采编协同
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam classBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam classBorderColor #46637F
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam nodesep 35
skinparam ranksep 45
hide empty description
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F5FAFF
skinparam stateBorderColor #46637F

state "待派发" as Unassigned
state "待同步" as Assigned
state "待审核" as Submitted
state "待修改" as Returned
state "已归档" as Archived
[*] --> Unassigned
note left of Unassigned: 有效需求建立协同后，默认进入待派发。
Unassigned --> Assigned : 派发同步()\n[部长有权且承接人属于办公部]\n/ 确立承接关系
Assigned --> Submitted : 提交同步结果()\n[当前承接人且成果完整]\n/ 保存成果版本
Submitted --> Returned : 审核并归档()\n[老师退回且意见完整]\n/ 保留修改意见
Returned --> Submitted : 提交同步结果()\n[当前承接人且修订完整]\n/ 保存修订版本
Submitted --> Archived : 审核并归档()\n[老师通过、材料齐备且计量依据可用]\n/ 归集贡献并保存归档依据
Archived : 审核并归档()\n[同一合法归档请求]\n/ 返回原结果，不重复计量
note bottom of Archived
  已归档对象继续供查询和重复请求核对，
  因此不画成对象消亡的终态。
  不满足事件资格或警戒条件时，拒绝并保持原状态。
end note

@enduml
